` Locale#weekdaysMin ` should be an array of two letter weekday abbreviations.
The purpose of these is for things like calendar pickers, thus they should be
as small as possible.



    moment.updateLocale('en', {
        weekdaysMin : ["Su", "Mo", "Tu", "We", "Th", "Fr", "Sa"]
    });


` Locale#weekdaysMin ` can be a callback function as well.



    moment.updateLocale('en', {
        weekdaysMin : function (momentToFormat, format) {
            return weekdaysMin[momentToFormat.day()];
        }
    });

